<title>UK: Credit Local adds 20 mln euros to Dec 2002 bond.</title>
<headline>Credit Local adds 20 mln euros to Dec 2002 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been increased to 120 million euros from 100 million euros, joint lead managers Banque Internationale a Luxembourg and Credit Communal/Gemeentenkredit said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CREDIT LOCAL</p>
<p> AMT    *120 MLN EURO COUPON     5.625     MATURITY    23.DEC.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  102.15    PAY DATE  S-06.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K)  1-10</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> NOTES   *ORIGINALLY LAUNCHED FOR 100 MILLION EURO ON 26.MAR.97</p>
<p>	    PAYABLE IN ECU UNTIL THIRD STAGE OF EMU.</p>
<p>	   S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
